// Highland County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, the Village of Leesburg, the historical society and others) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * Hillsboro City Schools moved to hcs-k12.org (hillsboro.k12.oh.us redirects).
//   * The Auditor's office pages are now hosted by Schneider Geospatial
//     (highlandoh-auditor.schneidergis.com); the property search itself is still
//     Pivot Point at highlandcountyauditor.org. The Beacon search link on the
//     Schneider site leads nowhere.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the county center run by Highland County
//     Community Action instead of the statewide site.
//   * The Highland County Historical Society's site is hchsohio.weebly.com; the
//     hchistoricalsociety address is now only its online store.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Highland County VA/FL; highlandcountyhistory.com is McDowell, Virginia;
//   hillsboromainstreet.org is Texas; hillsbororotary.org is Oregon; Highland
//   Heights OH; Leesburg VA/FL; Lynchburg VA/TN; Fairfield City / Fairfield County;
//   the Paxton Theatre is in Bainbridge (Ross); rockyforklake.com is a realtor.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Hillsboro, the seat). Villages with sites: Greenfield, Leesburg and
//     Lynchburg. Highland's only site says it is unofficial; Mowrystown and Sinking
//     Spring have none.
//   * Five school districts (Hillsboro City, Greenfield EV, Lynchburg-Clay, Bright,
//     Fairfield Local), served by the Southern Ohio ESC (Wilmington); Great Oaks runs
//     satellite career programs. Southern State Community College's central campus
//     is in Hillsboro.
//   * Mental health is the Paint Valley ADAMH Board; Highland Health Providers is
//     the county's FQHC.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * highlandcountyprosecutor.com, highlandhumane.com, highlandhabitat.org,
//     hillsboroswim.com and becausehelivesfoodpantry.com: the domains no longer
//     resolve.
//   * Buckskin Elementary (Greenfield EV) is in South Salem, Ross County.
//   * The Recovery Council: its own page is the Pike County Recovery Council.
//   * Townships, fire districts, park district, senior center, arts groups, service
//     clubs and Leesburg/Hillsboro festivals: Facebook only or no website.
//   * Treasurer payments and Recorder search: vendor portals.

